Aus Central W. Standard Time#!#+08:45
Aus Central Standard Time#!#+09:30
Cen. Australia Standard Time#!#+09:30
Lord Howe Standard Time#!#+10:30
Chatham Islands Standard Time#!#+12:45
~~END~~


